# Root build context, shared by the root Dockerfile (combined single-container build) and
# WebApi/Dockerfile (backend-only build, also uses the root context — see that file's header).
# frontend/node_modules is excluded but frontend/ itself is kept: the root Dockerfile still
# builds the SPA from source in its own stage.
**/bin/
**/obj/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
docs/
__ai_agents/
.git/
.github/
*.md
